1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:02,760
(Sheldon:)Penny?

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:08,330
(Howard:)Would you have opened the door
if you knew it was me?

3
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:09,600
(Penny:)Not since I found out

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,840
(Penny:)the teddy bear you gave me
had a webcam in it.

5
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:15,540
(Howard:)I just have a question.

6
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:18,110
(Howard:)Does Bernadette
ever talk about me?

7
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:19,080
(Penny:)Oh, absolutely.

8
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,310
(Howard:)She does?
Yeah, sure.

9
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,380
(Penny:)Just yesterday, she asked,

10
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,820
"Why is Howard hiding
under the table?"

11
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:26,250
(Howard:)She saw that, huh?

12
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:27,450
(Penny:)Oh, no, not at first.

13
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:29,390
(Penny:)Right after I pointed it out.

14
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:30,960
(Howard:)Let me ask you something else.

15
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:33,290
(Howard:)Is she seeing anybody?

16
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:34,730
Oh, not that I know of.

17
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:36,160
(Penny:)Hey, while
we're on the subject,

18
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,830
(Penny:)why did you guys break up
anyway?

19
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:39,900
(Howard:)Oh, I'd rather not say.

20
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:42,130
(Penny:)Howard, if you want my help,
I've got to know what happened.

21
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,670
(Howard:)But it's embarrassing...

22
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:46,340
(Penny:)Yeah, that's what
I'm counting on. Spill.

23
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:50,910
Okay. Well, you know
World of Warcraft?

24
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:52,580
(Penny:)Um, the online game? Sure.

25
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:54,010
(Howard:)Well, did you know

26
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:59,020
(Howard:)that the characters in the game
can have sex with each other?

